# Organization-owned ShellCheck exclusions belong here. Passing this file
# explicitly prevents a target repository's .shellcheckrc from changing
# either ShellCheck invocation.

# ShellCheck has no native ash mode and always checks ash scripts as dash,
# emitting this advisory note regardless of the script's content. Left
# enabled, every tracked ash script would fail the enforced standalone
# ShellCheck gate unless its author added a per-file silencing comment.
# Disabling it organization-wide keeps ash scripts admitted to the gate (as
# dash-checked, catching real dash-compatible diagnostics) without this
# unconditional false positive.
disable=SC2187
